    author: "Rohan Deshmukh",
    readTime: "5 min read",
    excerpt: "In-depth review of Manav Rachna University Online MBA in Faridabad, Haryana. Explore specializations in Business Analytics, Marketing, HR, affordable EMI plans, and placement tie-ups across Delhi NCR.",
    content: `<p>Based in Faridabad, Haryana, <strong>Manav Rachna University (MRU)</strong> has earned a strong reputation across the National Capital Region (NCR) for technical and management education. With its online wing, Manav Rachna Online offers UGC-DEB and AICTE approved degrees designed to help working professionals balance full-time jobs with flexible academic advancement.</p><p>In this review, we examine the <strong>Manav Rachna University Online MBA</strong> program, covering key highlights, fee options, course modules, and corporate placement support.</p><h3>Key Features & Approvals</h3><ul><li><strong>NAAC A Grade Institution:</strong> Accredited by NAAC with high academic rigor and robust infrastructure.</li><li><strong>UGC-DEB & AICTE Approved:</strong> Fully recognized for online delivery and management education standards.</li><li><strong>Strong NCR Corporate Ties:</strong> Strategically situated near Faridabad and Gurugram industrial corridors.</li><li><strong>Flexible Batch Timings:</strong> Weekend live classes combined with 24/7 LMS portal access.</li></ul><h3>Program Specializations & Syllabus</h3><p>Manav Rachna offers multi-disciplinary MBA tracks aligned with top industry demands:</p><ul><li><strong>Business Analytics:</strong> Python for managers, data visualization, business intelligence, and SQL analytics.</li><li><strong>Marketing & Sales Strategy:</strong> Digital sales funnels, SEO/SEM strategies, consumer insights, and retail management.</li><li><strong>Human Resource Management:</strong> HR analytics, strategic talent management, labor welfare, and compensation design.</li><li><strong>Finance & Accounting:</strong> Financial modeling, corporate taxation, managerial accounting, and investment banking basics.</li></ul><h3>Tuition Fees & Affordable Monthly Installments</h3><p>Manav Rachna Online MBA provides one of the most balanced pricing structures among NCR private universities:</p><ul><li><strong>Total Program Fee:</strong> Approx â‚¹96,000 total.</li><li><strong>Monthly EMI Starts At:</strong> Approx â‚¹2,000/month.</li><li><strong>No Hidden Costs:</strong> Inclusive of study portal access, digital library, and exam evaluations.</li></ul><h3>LMS & Student Experience</h3><p>The student LMS portal holds a rating of <strong>4.6/5</strong>. Learners benefit from self-assessment quizzes, virtual discussion forums, downloadable course summaries, and proctored online examinations.</p><h3>Verified Student Testimonial</h3><blockquote>"Manav Rachna's Online MBA in Business Analytics gave me practical data tools without requiring me to step away from my full-time analyst role in Faridabad. The weekend classes were structured, and the faculty was accessible." <br><cite>- Pooja Hegde (Online MBA Graduate)</cite></blockquote><h3>Placement Assistance</h3><p>Manav Rachna supports students with dedicated interview prep, CV building workshops, and placement referrals. Hiring partners include:</p><ul><li>Capgemini</li><li>Microsoft</li><li>Deloitte</li><li>Paytm</li><li>Infosys</li><li>HCL</li></ul><h3>Final Verdict</h3><p>If you live or work in the Delhi NCR region and want a respected NAAC A grade Online MBA under â‚¹1 Lakh total fee, <strong><a href="#catalog?university=manav_rachna_university_online">Manav Rachna University Online MBA</a></strong> is an excellent value recommendation. Get in touch with our team for enrollment guidance!</p>`
