    content: "\u003cp\u003eStudents aspiring to pursue master\u0027s degrees in the US, UK, Canada, or Australia often ask if Indian \u003cstrong\u003eOnline BBA degrees\u003c/strong\u003e are accepted internationally. Here is what you need to know.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWES \u0026 Educational Credential Assessment (ECA)\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorld Education Services (WES) and other foreign credential evaluation bodies recognize online degrees issued by NAAC A/A+ accredited Indian universities. The degree evaluates as a standard 3-year bachelor\u0027s degree equivalent.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eGlobal Master\u0027s Eligibility\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eGraduates are fully eligible to apply for Master of Science (MS) or MBA programs at overseas universities provided foreign language (IELTS/TOEFL) requirements are met.\u003c/p\u003e"
