    excerpt: "Unsure whether to attend a regular BBA college or enroll in an Online BBA? Compare cost, UGC validity, employer perception, and flexibility.",
    content: "\u003cp\u003eA major decision for 12th pass students and working aspirants is choosing between an \u003cstrong\u003eOnline BBA\u003c/strong\u003e and a traditional full-time classroom BBA. Here is a clear comparison across crucial parameters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e1. Legal Validity \u0026 UGC Equivalence\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePer the official UGC Gazette notification, an Online BBA degree from a UGC-DEB approved university holds \u003cstrong\u003e100% equal legal status\u003c/strong\u003e to a regular classroom degree. It is fully valid for CAT/MBA entrance exams, UPSC Civil Services, and MNC hiring.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e2. Cost \u0026 ROI Comparison\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cdiv class=\u0027table-responsive\u0027\u003e\u003ctable class=\u0027comparison-table\u0027 style=\u0027width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0;\u0027\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr style=\u0027background-color: var(--card-bg, #f1f3f5); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color, #e9ecef);\u0027\u003e\u003cth style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eParameter\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eOnline BBA\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eRegular BBA\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eTotal Fees\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eâ‚¹48,000 - â‚¹1,50,000\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eâ‚¹2,50,000 - â‚¹8,00,000\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eFlexibility\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eStudy anytime (Live + Recorded)\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eFixed Daily Campus Attendance\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eWork Experience\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eInternships/Jobs simultaneously\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\u0027padding:12px;\u0027\u003eFull-time Student\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor budget-conscious students and early-career learners, Online BBA provides exceptional Return on Investment (ROI).\u003c/p\u003e"
